# Supabase policies, held back until they have actually been run. The three faults this note
# used to list are fixed (2026-09-15, feat/member-login): the helpers no longer reference
# tables before they exist, auth.jwt() replaces current_setting(...)::jsonb, and the
# auth.users triggers can no longer fail a sign-in. What is still missing is a project to run
# them against — see docs/MEMBER-LOGIN-BUILD.md step 0.1. Untrack these once verify.sql has
# passed there, because unverified policies read as promises the database has not made.
supabase/portal.sql
supabase/verify.sql
